        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/c3b7271ed5c286929511882c627357e9.avif?t=1789120771\" width=864 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A cozy relaxing farming sim with a cute simplistic art style with vibrant colors, characters, and classic gameplay.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌿 <strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the noise of city life and start over on a colorful tropical island full of secrets and possibilities.<br>With a cute minimalist art style, vibrant colors, and relaxing classic gameplay, <i>Sunset Sprout</i> offers a peaceful <strong>farming and life simulation</strong> experience for players who love <i>cozy games</i>, <i>crafting</i>, and <i>island adventures</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/4ca598a40a65758e4eb5635d7678877d.poster.avif?t=1789120771\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/4ca598a40a65758e4eb5635d7678877d.webm?t=1789120771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/4ca598a40a65758e4eb5635d7678877d.mp4?t=1789120771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After realizing your 9–5 job isn’t making you happy, you decide to make a change — to become a farmer!<br>In the southern seas of Kur, you discover an oddly affordable island for sale. You put everything on the line — your savings, your car, and even most of your clothes — to buy it and start fresh on the <strong>Island of Sunset Sprout</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream farm, meet new friends, uncover the island’s mysteries, and become part of its close-knit <strong>community</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Deliver Orders</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/b90179c5a06ed82a246e300283c20e91.poster.avif?t=1789120771\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/b90179c5a06ed82a246e300283c20e91.webm?t=1789120771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/b90179c5a06ed82a246e300283c20e91.mp4?t=1789120771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌾 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌻 34+ unique plants and trees to grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐑 7+ types of adorable animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏡 12+ buildings and full farm expansions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌦️ Seasons, day–night cycle, and dynamic weather effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 A full main questline with character stories and island secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧺 50+ crafting recipes to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏝️ Visit your friends’ islands and explore together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💖 Cozy, relaxing gameplay designed for comfort and creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and so much more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Craft Items</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/536ebc6d625221e01884b71b57d2f9a5.poster.avif?t=1789120771\" width=910 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/536ebc6d625221e01884b71b57d2f9a5.webm?t=1789120771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/536ebc6d625221e01884b71b57d2f9a5.mp4?t=1789120771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, harvest, and manage your crops. Care for animals, decorate your home, and help rebuild the island.<br>Whether you’re tending your fields, exploring for hidden treasures, or chatting with the locals, <i>Sunset Sprout</i> offers a relaxing <strong>cozy farming sim</strong> experience perfect for fans of <i>Stardew Valley</i>, <i>Harvest Moon</i>, and <i>Animal Crossing</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>And so much more!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta